sxml version - Print the sxml library version

Usage: sxml version [--format=FORMAT]

Prints the version of the sxml library this program runs on, the same
line as 'sxml --version'. With --format=json, prints one JSON object
with the fields "name" and "version".

Options:
  -h, --help           Show this help and exit
      --format=FORMAT  Output format (one of: text, json; default: text)

Examples:
  sxml version
  sxml version --format=json
